  "inspectionMethods": {
    "coverage": "All576 native final frames (480main+96runtime),48whole-canvas atlases,48actual12fps MP4 clips,16registered-context MP4s, and all226 submitted preview aliases (225unique paths) were reviewed or verified through the equivalences described here. Retained historical model/shader drafts were hash-checked as resource closure only; they are not extra approved candidate states.",
    "nativeImages": "Viewed all576 sprite frames at exact logical .5scale through twelve judge-generated4facing\u00d712frame sheets, with one common empty-canvas crop. Independent alpha audit proves the crop contains all visible pixels in all576frames. Native heroes also inspected enlarged and all48 pose/facing frame05 exports independently rerendered from the reopened exact sealed Blender projects.",
    "atlasesAndBackgroundAliases": "All48 atlases match their12whole384\u00d7640 RGBA cells exactly. All144 submitted light/gray/dark strips have exact logical-size raster equality to the corresponding576 native source frame cells after background composition. Reviewed all frames through the verified gray sheets, all three background all-state/facing overviews, selected enlarged light/dark strips, original target/source comparison and every browser screenshot. This does not claim a separate unaided visual viewing of144entire strips: frame and background equivalence is explicit, measured evidence.",
    "temporalPlayback": "Opened the exact48encoded MP4 URLs in Chrome using a judge-owned logical192\u00d7320 video grid, observed readyState4 and advancing playback, and inspected four3state pages. Sit-down/stand-up/happy source one-shots stop at duration1s; loops keep playing. Opened all16context MP4s at aspect-correct logical192\u00d7352 in two4facing\u00d72state pages. The submitted playback index itself animates native canvases and links the MP4s; the judge separately opened actual MP4s. ffprobe confirms all48source clips and16contexts are12fps,12frames,1s.",
    "registeredContexts": "Reviewed stool-eating and390\u00d7844phone composites, supplied phone/browser screenshots and actual registered context playback. Whole sprite canvases keep their root/scale while the separate stool supports the raised seated pose. No UI/production files changed."
