  "scoreInterpretation": "Comparative evidence against the independently recorded source baseline and frozen criteria, not a universal numeric approval threshold.",
  "observations": [
    "The native cap now reads as a soft rounded folded form with a thicker controlled crown edge and gently lit brim. Rounded head/cheeks/nose, calmer moustache lobes, smoother palms/thumb transitions and stronger green garment volume visibly improve on the hard primitive source. These are useful modeling and material improvements within the functional envelope.",
    "Medium tan skin, yellow cap, blue-gray/blue-black hair and moustache, green shirt, separate teal panel and navy/dark lower body retain Samir identity. Broad warm highlights and lighter shadow transitions remove the source\u2019s harsh lower-body/hair blackness without erasing the dark-color hierarchy.",
    "The cap, cheeks, sleeves, panel and shoe divisions remain readable at logical192\u00d7320. The all-facing head and body treatment is coherent through head tilts, raised hands and sitting/eating motions. The side/rear cropped haircut is deliberately quieter and flatter than the front fringe, with a clean continuous short-hair profile; it does not produce an opaque black dead spot or broken surface.",
    "All576 reviewed frames are free of material alpha halos, exposed ends, detached pieces, severe intersections, texture swimming, flickering normals, blown highlights or directional ground shadows. The actual encoded playback remains stable and preserves source loop/one-shot behavior.",
    "Main catalog meals correctly use the exact canonical cucumber raster; supplemental eating uses the exact canonical salmon raster, and empty waiting stays empty. The food remains an explicitly2D packed alpha composition. At constant .30cell display depth, E/W meals are naturally partially occluded by the head and N meals remain hidden by the opaque head; no per-view visibility change or body-contact shift forces food through the body.",
    "The imported delivery adapter preserves the original raw-frame path order, every original atlas field and pixel order, adding explicit frame associations/frameOrder/scale aliases backed by actual old native measurements. Main480phase matrices (120per facing) and runtime96phase matrices (24per facing) agree with independently evaluated native root matrices; no expected-rotation synthesis was used."
  ],
  "blockers": [],
  "remainingDifferences": [
    "The target has finer cap stitching and more elaborate collar/garment seams; the candidate keeps quiet larger construction cues that survive intended size. Those target details are inspiration rather than a pixel-identity requirement.",
    "The side/rear hair treatment is a simpler cropped silhouette with less lobe volume than the front-reference hair. It remains coherent with Samir\u2019s short-hair identity and does not require copying an unspecified rear target.",
    "The compact navy legs and shoe proportions remain closer to source functional anatomy than the target\u2019s larger cuffed boots. The source rig, chair support, maximum clip heights and ground contacts constrain that difference.",
    "The exact approved food dependencies remain2D raster planes and may be partially or wholly body-occluded according to facing; native3D food was neither requested nor claimed."
  ],
